# Brand & assets

- Product: **NaturaVive**
- Contact / domain: fill `@/config/site` (phone, email, social, live URL)
- Asset pack root: `public/assets/naturavive/`
- Logos: `public/assets/naturavive/brand/`
- Hero scenes: `hero/hero-scene-*.jpg` + `hero/hero-product-cluster-clear.png`
- Products (clear): `products/*-clear.png` (black studio bg → use `.nv-knockout-black`)
- Section frame bg: `backgrounds/section-frame-botanical.jpg`
- Subscribe: `subscribe/wellness-lifestyle-woman-clear.jpg`
- Icons: `public/assets/naturavive/icons/`
- Trust: `public/assets/naturavive/trust/`
- App icons: `src/app/icon.png`, `src/app/apple-icon.png`, `public/favicon.png`
- Paths in code: only via `@/config/brand` (`brandAssets`, `brandTokens`)
- Colours: primary `#1B4332` · leaf `#3D6B4F` · accent `#B88916` · ink `#1A1A1A`
- Copy: no em/en dashes; use commas, periods, or ` - `
- Social / UI icons: pack SVGs via `BrandIcon` + `.nv-icon-ink` / `.nv-icon-leaf`
